        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-BDS550, 5-1/2\" Long Contemporary Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNot only does this 5-1/2\" long contemporary door stop look great, it is made to last from solid brass. It is easy to install; just screw onto the baseboard casement or door bottom and it will protect your doors, walls, knobs or levers. It includes both gray and white rubber tips and installation screw. Available in your choice of 7 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-BDS550_size.gif?v=1704354507\" width\"600\" height=\"170\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Long Contemporary Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-BDS550 Long Contemporary Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rubber-replacement-tip-for-contemporary-door-stop-deltana-bds450-repl-tip\"><b>Rubber Bumper Tips</b></a>: White and Gray Tips included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BDS550.pdf?v=1691095271\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-BDS550 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
